{"book":"kinney","chapter":"aws","chapterTitle":"نشر تطبيقات الويب على AWS","slug":"static-site-deployment-solution","title":"الحل: نشر موقع ثابت من البداية إلى النهاية","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"لماذا-يعمل-هذا","text":"لماذا يعمل هذا"},{"depth":2,"id":"إنشاء-حاوية-s3","text":"إنشاء حاوية S3"},{"depth":2,"id":"ارفع-موقعك","text":"ارفع موقعك"},{"depth":2,"id":"إنشاء-origin-access-control","text":"إنشاء Origin Access Control"},{"depth":2,"id":"إنشاء-توزيع-cloudfront","text":"إنشاء توزيع CloudFront"},{"depth":2,"id":"تحديث-سياسة-حاوية-s3","text":"تحديث سياسة حاوية S3"},{"depth":2,"id":"التحقق-من-خط-الأنابيب-الكامل","text":"التحقق من خط الأنابيب الكامل"},{"depth":2,"id":"اختبار-عملية-نشر","text":"اختبار عملية نشر"},{"depth":2,"id":"ملخص-الموارد-المنشأة","text":"ملخص الموارد المنشأة"}],"html":"<p>هذا هو الحل الكامل لـ<a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/courses/aws/static-site-deployment-exercise\">تمرين نشر موقع ثابت من البداية إلى النهاية</a>. وقد أدرجت كل أمر مع ناتجه المتوقع كي تقارن أثناء عملك.</p>\n<h2 id=\"لماذا-يعمل-هذا\">لماذا يعمل هذا</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>يحوّل سير العمل هذا خدمتين إلى مسار نشر واحد: S3 يخزّن الملفات، وCloudFront يقدّمها عبر HTTPS على نطاق <code>*.cloudfront.net</code>.</li>\n<li>تبقى الحاوية خاصة لأن CloudFront هو نقطة الدخول العامة الوحيدة التي تحتاج إلى وصول قراءة مباشر.</li>\n<li>حلقة المزامنة مع الإبطال في النهاية هي دورة النشر العملية التي ستكررها طويلًا بعد انتهاء التمرين.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>إن أردت نسخة AWS من سير العمل من البداية إلى النهاية مفتوحة أثناء عملك، فأبقِ <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/HostingWebsiteOnS3Setup.html\">درس موقع S3 الثابت</a> و<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-restricting-access-to-s3.html\">دليل OAC في CloudFront</a> قريبين.</p>\n<h2 id=\"إنشاء-حاوية-s3\">إنشاء حاوية S3</h2>\n<p>أنشئ الحاوية:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3 mb s3://my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>الناتج المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>make_bucket: my-frontend-app-assets\n</code></pre>\n<p>مكّن حظر الوصول العام:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3api put-public-access-block \\\n  --bucket my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --public-access-block-configuration \\\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;BlockPublicAcls=true,IgnorePublicAcls=true,BlockPublicPolicy=true,RestrictPublicBuckets=true&quot;</span> \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>لا ناتج عند النجاح.</p>\n<p>تحقّق:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3api get-public-access-block \\\n  --bucket my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;PublicAccessBlockConfiguration&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;BlockPublicAcls&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;IgnorePublicAcls&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;BlockPublicPolicy&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;RestrictPublicBuckets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"ارفع-موقعك\">ارفع موقعك</h2>\n<p>أنشئ موقعًا أدنى إن لم يكن لديك واحد:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">mkdir</span> -p build\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;title&gt;My Site&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;h1&gt;It works.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&#x27;</span> &gt; build/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>ارفع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3 <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sync</span> ./build s3://my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>الناتج المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>upload: build/index.html to s3://my-frontend-app-assets/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>تحقّق:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3 <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">ls</span> s3://my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>2026-03-18 12:00:00        102 index.html\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"إنشاء-origin-access-control\">إنشاء Origin Access Control</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront create-origin-access-control \\\n  --origin-access-control-config <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;{\n    &quot;Name&quot;: &quot;my-frontend-app-oac&quot;,\n    &quot;Description&quot;: &quot;OAC for my-frontend-app-assets S3 bucket&quot;,\n    &quot;SigningProtocol&quot;: &quot;sigv4&quot;,\n    &quot;SigningBehavior&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,\n    &quot;OriginAccessControlOriginType&quot;: &quot;s3&quot;\n  }&#x27;</span> \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Location&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;https://cloudfront.amazonaws.com/2020-05-31/origin-access-control/E1OAC2EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ETag&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1ETAG1EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControl&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1OAC2EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControlConfig&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Name&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-frontend-app-oac&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;OAC for my-frontend-app-assets S3 bucket&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;SigningProtocol&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;sigv4&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;SigningBehavior&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;always&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControlOriginType&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;s3&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>احفظ قيمة <code>Id</code> (<code>E1OAC2EXAMPLE</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"إنشاء-توزيع-cloudfront\">إنشاء توزيع CloudFront</h2>\n<p>احفظ ما يلي باسم <code>distribution-config.json</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CallerReference&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-frontend-app-2026-03-18&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Comment&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;CloudFront distribution for my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Enabled&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DefaultRootObject&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;PriceClass&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;PriceClass_100&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;HttpVersion&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;http2and3&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;IsIPV6Enabled&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Origins&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S3-my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DomainName&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-frontend-app-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControlId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1OAC2EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;S3OriginConfig&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessIdentity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DefaultCacheBehavior&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;TargetOriginId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S3-my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ViewerProtocolPolicy&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;redirect-to-https&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CachePolicyId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;658327ea-f89d-4fab-a63d-7e88639e58f6&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Compress&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;AllowedMethods&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;GET&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HEAD&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CachedMethods&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;GET&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HEAD&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CustomErrorResponses&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">403</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponsePagePath&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponseCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;200&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCachingMinTTL&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">404</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponsePagePath&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponseCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;200&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCachingMinTTL&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ViewerCertificate&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CloudFrontDefaultCertificate&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Restrictions&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;GeoRestriction&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;RestrictionType&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;none&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>أنشئ التوزيع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront create-distribution \\\n  --distribution-config file://distribution-config.json \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع (مختصرًا):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Distribution&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1A2B3C4D5E6F7&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ARN&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;arn:aws:cloudfront::123456789012:distribution/E1A2B3C4D5E6F7&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DomainName&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Status&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;InProgress&quot;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>احفظ معرّف التوزيع واسم النطاق.</p>\n<p>انتظر النشر:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">wait</span> distribution-deployed \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>لا ناتج عند النجاح. تحقّق:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>HTTP/2 200\ncontent-type: text/html\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"تحديث-سياسة-حاوية-s3\">تحديث سياسة حاوية S3</h2>\n<p>احفظ ما يلي باسم <code>bucket-policy-oac.json</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Version&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;2012-10-17&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Statement&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Sid&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;AllowCloudFrontServicePrincipal&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Effect&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Allow&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Principal&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Service&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cloudfront.amazonaws.com&quot;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Action&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;s3:GetObject&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Resource&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;arn:aws:s3:::my-frontend-app-assets/*&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Condition&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;StringEquals&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;AWS:SourceArn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;arn:aws:cloudfront::123456789012:distribution/E1A2B3C4D5E6F7&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>طبّق السياسة:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3api put-bucket-policy \\\n  --bucket my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --policy file://bucket-policy-oac.json \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>لا ناتج عند النجاح.</p>\n<p>تحقّق من أن CloudFront ما زال يعمل:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع: <code>200 OK</code>.</p>\n<p>تحقّق من أن الوصول المباشر إلى S3 محظور:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://my-frontend-app-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع: <code>403 Forbidden</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"التحقق-من-خط-الأنابيب-الكامل\">التحقق من خط الأنابيب الكامل</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># HTTPS works on the CloudFront domain</span>\ncurl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>HTTP/2 200\ncontent-type: text/html\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># SPA routing works</span>\ncurl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/any/spa/route\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>HTTP/2 200\ncontent-type: text/html\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Direct S3 access is blocked</span>\ncurl -I https://my-frontend-app-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"اختبار-عملية-نشر\">اختبار عملية نشر</h2>\n<p>حدّث محتوى الموقع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">echo</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;title&gt;My Site&lt;/title&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Updated content.&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&#x27;</span> &gt; build/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>زامن إلى S3:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3 <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">sync</span> ./build s3://my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --delete \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>upload: build/index.html to s3://my-frontend-app-assets/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>أبطل الذاكرة المؤقتة:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront create-invalidation \\\n  --distribution-id E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --paths <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/*&quot;</span> \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Invalidation&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;I1EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Status&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;InProgress&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CreateTime&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;2026-03-18T12:05:00Z&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;InvalidationBatch&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Paths&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/*&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CallerReference&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cli-1710763500&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>انتظر دقيقة، ثم تحقّق:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -s https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net | grep <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Updated content&quot;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;h1&gt;Updated content.&lt;/h1&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"ملخص-الموارد-المنشأة\">ملخص الموارد المنشأة</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>المورد</th>\n<th>المعرّف</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>حاوية S3</td>\n<td><code>my-frontend-app-assets</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Origin Access Control</td>\n<td><code>E1OAC2EXAMPLE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>توزيع CloudFront</td>\n<td><code>E1A2B3C4D5E6F7</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>نطاق CloudFront</td>\n<td><code>d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>سياسة حاوية S3</td>\n<td>وصول CloudFront فقط عبر OAC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>موقعك الثابت الآن مباشر على <code>https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net</code>، مقدَّمًا عالميًا عبر CloudFront، ومخزَّنًا في حاوية S3 خاصة، ومؤمَّنًا بـ HTTPS عبر شهادة CloudFront الافتراضية. وتحدّث دورة النشر (المزامنة + الإبطال) الموقع في أقل من دقيقة.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>نصيحة</strong></p>\n<p>أتريد وضع هذا خلف نطاق مخصّص؟ راجع قسم <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/courses/aws/dns-for-frontend-engineers\">النطاقات المخصّصة وDNS والشهادات</a> الاختياري في نهاية الدورة.</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}